Aku pikir dia anjing seperti yang lain.

1325
01:36:50,844 --> 01:36:52,580
Seperti kau.

1326
01:36:52,614 --> 01:36:54,014
Seperti mereka.

1327
01:36:55,617 --> 01:36:58,753
