1356
01:39:14,856 --> 01:39:16,925
Jangan bergerak.

1357
01:39:19,594 --> 01:39:21,596
<i>Samuel Houser.</i>

1358
01:39:21,629 --> 01:39:25,065
<i>Letakkan senjatamu.</i>
<i>Keluarlah.</i>

1359
01:39:25,098 --> 01:39:26,634
<i>Kau ditangkap.</i>

1360
01:39:49,389 --> 01:39:51,058
Ayo, pergi!

1361
