Pergi!

1362
01:40:33,735 --> 01:40:35,135
Cepat! Cepat! Cepat!

1363
01:43:25,540 --> 01:43:26,641
Ayah?

1364
01:43:28,109 --> 01:43:29,209
Ayah?

1365
