Turunkan senjata kalian.

1382
01:45:17,618 --> 01:45:18,853
Sial!

1383
01:45:18,886 --> 01:45:20,288
Polly!

1384
01:45:20,320 --> 01:45:21,321
Turunkan senjata kalian

1385
01:45:21,354 --> 01:45:22,590
atau aku tembak dia di kepala!

1386
01:45:22,623 --> 01:45:24,025
