Terima kasih.

1415
01:48:54,201 --> 01:48:55,469
Hai.

1416
01:48:55,503 --> 01:48:58,339
Polly, ini Maya.

1417
01:48:58,372 --> 01:48:59,673
Maya, ini Polly.

1418
01:48:59,707 --> 01:49:01,709
Senang bertemu, Polly.

1419
01:49:01,742 --> 01:49:03,544
Hai.

1420
01:49:03,577 --> 01:49:05,312
